
=== The analytics table (input of the 3 models) ===
One flat table from the warehouse; each inspection also gets the previous inspection of the same place.

$ psql -h localhost -U foodsafety -d foodsafety -P pager=off -f sql/08_analytics_mart.sql
psql:sql/08_analytics_mart.sql:3: NOTICE:  drop cascades to table mart.food_inspection_analytics_mart
DROP SCHEMA
CREATE SCHEMA
SELECT 61737
CREATE INDEX
ANALYZE

